  "speakingPlannedMaximumSeconds": 410.304,
  "cache": [
    {
      "key": "9163d9feb9943551ec8e642a",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "今天的家务怎么分？你打扫客厅，我洗碗，好吗？",
      "sha256": "5a85fa0233dba7513e224dcd7c78e9ae19dfbfd9b50acb392ea091e7e1bc32a2"
    },
    {
      "key": "fadb9c11b3247441b8b69dbe",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "我更想洗碗，客厅请你打扫，可以吗？",
      "sha256": "3e3f8a2e14bde08c29eacb5d433ee44d8e7d3a47d45664496b27ac8137f10da8"
    },
    {
      "key": "31f216067e7eee9b4dee63f4",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "好，那就这样。",
      "sha256": "7d58431d0f2fd5c9b978cbe542d7d1ae69c73f924822372e7e1190c17fa1a582"
    },
    {
      "key": "34e89f8d03ace2b111d8dc37",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第1题。",
      "sha256": "3895df58b8b6ce61365216490dcb339db3aa7ef168eef8d2098c469073a4cdc2"
    },
    {
      "key": "73cee90fde862b484c30d9c6",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "社区活动星期六十点开始。我九点要在家打扫厨房，九点半出门。活动十二点结束以后，我再去买菜。",
      "sha256": "b7fa782a60199e7ff280ae9f15a0b91d759bd756998ca33dc46dc518fd17186b"
    },
    {
      "key": "1741fb60958696627ba5f0ed",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第2题。",
      "sha256": "39f2c75a46983608745be0da5fe2130f1e77b5cd88f7b9b3928a0a06485a2744"
    },
    {
      "key": "a73f53c0b9952ffb157c5cbf",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "我平时每天晚上洗碗，星期六和星期日不用洗，因为这两天爸爸做家务。我每个星期洗五次，每次大约十分钟。",
      "sha256": "6ffe63c176a773fd2dac5dfb740c08d7c70d9108a12ef7a01840ceb4a58f1a0d"
    },
    {
      "key": "97e9c8d06f3e0171388ee24b",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第3题。",
      "sha256": "74d7fdba0fd9fae146470574deadbd8616eca796fece18aaf8190b3792f4225e"
    },
    {
      "key": "471e78af96c5cc573d97a7e3",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "你平时六点散步，今天也一样吗？",
      "sha256": "33a25f33b3024197eda8edac7167004d7fbfd181f9ab3753a8126bc438cdc1d8"
    },
    {
      "key": "b41deb550cf0223eb687cc19",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "今天六点要开会，七点才下班。我想下班后走半个小时。",
      "sha256": "d138700765dc9619d3b4ccfb9f85d5c6b471fed62b6fc6ade0f78bcedd1d8cb3"
    },
    {
      "key": "ce11862c436a80257829e484",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "那我七点在楼下等你。",
      "sha256": "cc620b9edb692e9d8560ead8b9616c69ef9d5051be181917bf32bc3e6f1a0a94"
    },
    {
      "key": "b25d3caab3d72c3d0347de4b",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第4题。",
      "sha256": "cc38e6d168e0664b2b8f98558b26288abcea294390f4e9aa13d8f457ef5a7046"
    },
    {
      "key": "13961070c6573d13721f2771",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "小安最近每天晚上看电视到十二点，第二天起床总觉得累。昨天她十点就关了电视，今天早上起床的时候觉得舒服多了。",
      "sha256": "41875f3a34de98c111c4d150b83c6d88d1e9193f17b9ae08af77f2255ddbaf92"
    },
    {
      "key": "c5b1d9675aba74bbd668ea00",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第5题。",
      "sha256": "057a4202f7d25216a190a84d6056c30f42be93ac60cdc21879a97aaaf19252d9"
    },
    {
      "key": "501dc6bae82e12c45c68d8bc",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "你现在去市场吗？",
      "sha256": "ca18717cd641333ba9b31a7c9748f4983ec6e988d18a941c4e327f7944a5a8c4"
    },
    {
      "key": "51978713ea184fd659998ddc",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "不是，我先去图书馆还书。还完书再到对面的市场买菜，中午回家做饭。",
      "sha256": "e40cc6c53a194c2403f8e9aa51ac15c8840c743e12f4967b921fd10d5d33eb0d"
    },
    {
      "key": "24feb3e3b704b7d30cde46e1",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "那我在图书馆门口等你。",
      "sha256": "bdc8715a0cb5479c9ac1e3b143bf2306a47bab07058083c914898b5e754db4cc"
    },
    {
      "key": "5e6c5b336701fe2c48b7fa2f",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第6题。",
      "sha256": "fcc5b0fabad8f1fa79148054a17b60ac8d2cb351d57ed0d5eb073df550e3ee93"
    },
    {
      "key": "1bf111f9759687c1876828e9",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "去图书馆坐地铁只要十分钟，我们坐地铁吧。",
      "sha256": "f3709d650f07b3226864acfe6ae6f5a836108a380b114f2422e74f4ed419026f"
    },
    {
      "key": "9ea7b49be8a54beedcd7af2e",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "今天地铁站不开门，还是坐公交车吧，二十分钟能到。",
      "sha256": "65a53a04e379fffbc5eaf4542e1907ad97928a05c10029731cfe3c6a0c3b532d"
    },
    {
      "key": "b3f8c76fb0bacb3569dc2d72",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "好，我去车站等你。",
      "sha256": "d3c248f9d676b649094db8e4ccc20dcfd0175a08baa40a50345f5ab9e7321c24"
    },
    {
      "key": "79e0bdfd02236c1d4253adc0",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第7题。",
      "sha256": "5151859d99f51fb43c1c4ba74a72c7d8898fd12ebdb151ca350243f27169a52c"
    },
    {
      "key": "9284d6e7f473235f50e46837",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "从车站到图书馆怎么走？",
      "sha256": "d0c50f4ff2c5b6eb23f71a4e7cde0d427b614606b3a44d9752be07fbeacdf673"
    },
    {
      "key": "6c6fbcb55e42683894caa583",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "下车后先向右走，到第一个路口再向左。图书馆就在银行旁边，不用过马路。",
      "sha256": "fd0795546726817d721ecd9457ebd2d305cc836cb5df5a4e65eaa761979694fe"
    },
    {
      "key": "7f1c230ce8401805a0b97608",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "好，我记住了。",
      "sha256": "54766fff917cffa8f9333bd1e38b56217521f8183efd10cc2d03328e2fef8e14"
    },
    {
      "key": "b431efe26b8c6cc712ef43b8",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第8题。",
      "sha256": "65ff1f952179bc643f6b488a3150eee5a21667f5901053151fd7aeb53f0c7786"
    },
    {
      "key": "1cc90468b2f04bf4af78de1b",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "去图书馆有两条路。走河边比较近，可是没有灯；走商店那边远五分钟，但是一路都有灯。",
      "sha256": "4e93d8884b75b00003a2934991996db37dd987ce0a4e020560414b9897715610"
    },
    {
      "key": "cf277f723e733731f3369646",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "现在天黑了，我不着急，走商店那边吧。",
      "sha256": "0cb485daf724c1a8b20a39a1ccb718135e8745b69cfb9eae67aa2186ab2a0ff8"
    },
    {
      "key": "76f9b7034e5801a6360f40bd",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第9题。",
      "sha256": "439f37e4f9738e7ac1dc180f588ae4ed900731c0623d4038b9f3533da20c0ada"
    },
    {
      "key": "55b4933690b3a948281e5207",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "明天上午下雨，原来九点在公园见的活动怎么办？",
      "sha256": "1678dd12d690865a8413638edd776dd2bf2c184ec7f4b270fbabe03e8641edcb"
    },
    {
      "key": "9f347a14fac2314f57c25084",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "改在图书馆吧。不过图书馆十点才开门，我们十点半见。",
      "sha256": "0e212e8c9c94dcc55502e64ce60131fde21e1da51b5833197bcf2a8cb2df7193"
    },
    {
      "key": "9ef6358c2b9f04e60fdc89e0",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "好，就这么定了。",
      "sha256": "812ea31e0eef554456b22a1b25c0928bca1d85c41b09b30a20057b8efe020ac7"
    },
    {
      "key": "86d64da7bc27367110de5cb7",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第10题。",
      "sha256": "a443b83201af7bae91780e167c2fcd53ef523b448bf77dd4ad6b238de2e582d2"
    },
    {
      "key": "40ac5923c2a7d175815397e4",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "我们四个人，一人一碗面，好吗？",
      "sha256": "170763e5838c820419ac3d407b6a14e7e11b04d3a5b318d18d22ef81008371b1"
    },
    {
      "key": "ec1e4eec79d04e5c0b250a2e",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "我和哥哥想吃米饭，妈妈和妹妹吃面。",
      "sha256": "9c86223350733d35ec2ddb8b2ab095066c9c733129794f4bcc8324ee7675e9aa"
    },
    {
      "key": "afdeab3306418808bc20d8cf",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "那就两碗面、两份米饭，再点一个菜。",
      "sha256": "e8ce68f9221f11a0734c8b6ba2e300cc512ab768727fefd1389e7ccfb958afc6"
    },
    {
      "key": "63d3dd3f27ad85dca9aa0606",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第11题。",
      "sha256": "09609165ce7b5b5bbc80de6236e7726415e2ab45d65241e1ca3c75ec4a697f32"
    },
    {
      "key": "7e8db33982de2aba80369ee2",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "这件小号的衣服好看，你试过了吗？",
      "sha256": "002fedccac608fc9ae374ebe5de51166e72b0f050e094db2277840117c7cb422"
    },
    {
      "key": "9149195ca33c0d6370755367",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "试过了，太小。我想买大号，颜色还是蓝色，不要红色。",
      "sha256": "a6df79089a9341eef9fe8712b27de885614dc149d1b74c4a4e99f64ba8f8c057"
    },
    {
      "key": "5ed19b6e38a0868bc01e52df",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "好，我帮你找蓝色大号。",
      "sha256": "84370faf3048bcd2166dd392aa44452a3e3d3a06427cdf4a62d462db2177255e"
    },
    {
      "key": "2dbff9b332f7edc61b4c3c18",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第12题。",
      "sha256": "f25ea7d43ed9f81b7dd1af25fa0339498c7d458e79931122755e838f8d314a83"
    },
    {
      "key": "19364a1ebfc4ce71072f7671",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "这份午饭十五块，汤另外三块。",
      "sha256": "3610762560a6725ce9e3de226e0278eeb78abcca244b9396ee47a42463d58dce"
    },
    {
      "key": "5a29adfe2bfaedae377964f2",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "我只要午饭，不要汤。给你二十块。",
      "sha256": "fd986c4a22a56198c2ce65af195ac9b7179be30cff54f7c4dd56279fc1f3b613"
    },
    {
      "key": "47d0ada06acc42e801f6a614",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "好的，午饭十五块，找你五块。",
      "sha256": "ea073575801ae67e489f2262527bdd97808a658d3c33d753d7ce79bb998fc13c"
    },
    {
      "key": "ec1acc6c51d958bc6eb290a5",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第13题。",
      "sha256": "e6515323a9eef38c0320124c2e99d81f002d229d597de7f44a76008521622c43"
    },
    {
      "key": "609e4e810667e6bb060ff8fb",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "小林不吃辣，小周不吃肉，晚上点什么好？",
      "sha256": "7f2f6054c0aa290f9d259f7973db8823abda0ad142d176ab4703ff94b3f849c2"
    },
    {
      "key": "356e2e62e6aef40c5ad387de",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "辣牛肉不行。鸡蛋面没有肉，也不辣，十八块；白菜汤虽然便宜，但大家想吃面。",
      "sha256": "0b13d3c935aedcbc83c7996fdcd7b79afab03dbb92b81ec8c112e652eb9ef5c9"
    },
    {
      "key": "ee145cdd15b4fee78c2041ca",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "那就点鸡蛋面。",
      "sha256": "2c7d7b951f822ad03ba57bf6862ba9092d7512ba30c080bab954cecd55419027"
    },
    {
      "key": "6a9458d981e42c448c56e5d7",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第14题。",
      "sha256": "3c248ca1222db546caafa3ccef0afeb1d63689c8e501a91b906f7c38012bc8f4"
    },
    {
      "key": "0b22c0ed8e55ce41005562de",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "家里没有牛奶了，你下班后去买两瓶吧。",
      "sha256": "e05977626b50db20a650f831abc16abc9e083aeba88e9303a93edff72b231191"
    },
    {
      "key": "88de3deff03cd4fc7c8d8ac5",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "我今天五点要开会，商店六点关门，恐怕来不及。",
      "sha256": "79d0010b6738422f17fc5c406e89c060ba6f80b409fc6d8fbbba4da283d7f332"
    },
    {
      "key": "000f943da5168cd46536caa5",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "那我现在去，你晚上回来洗碗就好。",
      "sha256": "1d15a45b1bdad54dd485b6e48939ce913500d8def933a87233ff5e74222ca581"
    },
    {
      "key": "9d1b8c046279c5b498214791",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第15题。",
      "sha256": "774136cf8893575562e62fc53ca824d970e119df2986004fbc9a795341529ed7"
    },
    {
      "key": "58e9fddd77d9dc20eb848d88",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "今天早上有点儿冷，还下了小雨。天气预报说下午不下雨了，会出太阳，最高二十度。我们下午再去公园，不用现在出门。",
      "sha256": "7d8226effd137dbb4a202147c11a281aaeff209a7819f6d494969f4845b35b4e"
    },
    {
      "key": "0cffbf1010d1e54023057ea9",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第16题。",
      "sha256": "6cbe22b4463ef0127dbcb5957919648ee9b071c97d70d0b85edf327b6a0071df"
    },
    {
      "key": "cb24394001fa9b237510da37",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "周日天气很好，为什么不在公园做活动？",
      "sha256": "a08f5bd66eee7f5fc6de62f79a6cb0456b046143b73cfbbb1df0acadb75dede4"
    },
    {
      "key": "abb97a21622d2df148434df5",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "公园的门坏了，周日不开。我们改在社区中心，时间还是下午两点。",
      "sha256": "95a190609323c7ddfb95a7845aee2269a044a786cfcd6ab89c8d4cb22b3d1fbf"
    },
    {
      "key": "fb11e97b5f64c93800e0e987",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "原来是这样。",
      "sha256": "de807918c11ea142f13c43526c6330485344cebbce607e1c734b2073d7b98745"
    },
    {
      "key": "61f4d2e4e5f3e0536be36453",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第17题。",
      "sha256": "7b303e3cdea4e6b338b981ca7d27218c5da50fd4e2ca1cb297c3ba0853fbff6b"
    },
    {
      "key": "dbf795f0ef3f6cff38b51cd1",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "我今天想散步，但是只能走二十分钟。",
      "sha256": "c77d846bcd47b62b39edcb176f21210864c9150a58ac188f354cd625cb7652a6"
    },
    {
      "key": "594ff42bc015edd51e401da0",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "去湖边来回要四十分钟，小区里的路来回十五分钟。你走完以后还可以休息一会儿。",
      "sha256": "29a38b10fb7d502270758387aa1e9f5acbf22aa5280cbce12371681a3678fcd0"
    },
    {
      "key": "d947b2ac1067644ac4328ebe",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "好，就在小区里走。",
      "sha256": "b7642b21e64cc15286e021df43b9f1ae536570b097e669edf49d4e5faedec1a6"
    },
    {
      "key": "2e9092b1191d42999a9f695d",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第18题。",
      "sha256": "b0832c56a97774c35b538f689f08bf8314e263e14ab809871867bcdede27a70b"
    },
    {
      "key": "579ee9832eba919808e5eb7b",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "上周我们去社区参加春节活动。先看小朋友唱歌，再跟老师写汉字。写完字以后，大家一起吃午饭。我第一次参加这样的活动，觉得很有意思。",
      "sha256": "3370f705081e296f86d670bb54ae150b7aa557ddbbaf8268ce023a70f62664b8"
    },
    {
      "key": "ee9540a1a810afba0a3a7056",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第19题。",
      "sha256": "91a1a230e642a4906da5e058c485a56cf6a1c77b67c899338da1843b7db5066e"
    },
    {
      "key": "9d8b68093b15057923f3e018",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "第一次去社区春节活动的时候，小雨只想待半个小时。后来活动结束了，她还在问下次什么时候再办，又告诉妹妹下次一定要一起来。",
      "sha256": "d47a356c8dabe4d1629dac8bde3b279ad1126066ca20fef8b70ee135c0856aeb"
    },
    {
      "key": "689adfbaa5b63ac16b96aac6",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第20题。",
      "sha256": "f2a7aa65a74fad7dc9d19d81d6990ac99260287106ff304656efb599e75400e1"
    },
    {
      "key": "96b5bbdad65f524e21a45ce8",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "星期六一起吃午饭吧。你有什么不想吃的，或者不能吃的东西？",
      "sha256": "7ad49bef295f189668a631f1925f05a2e88242021dba176119ed747301687743"
    },
    {
      "key": "2c3ae610698699cd0a8383f8",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "店里有米饭，也有面条。你想选哪一种？也可以选别的。",
      "sha256": "b426df711ce91f23cd74c7870aa5e87f6dec3b8839e2249b47462d0eecea7e80"
    },
    {
      "key": "4be6c1a08eea387d6eec79f0",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "你为什么想这样选？请给我说一个理由。",
      "sha256": "c23c9f7888f31337e8dec78fccadd07152becd5f424efa0bf1371910f0b46eb5"
    },
    {
      "key": "d08e31433bda2fffd692bcb3",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "我十二点有事，一点才能到。你方便吗？不方便的话，可以怎么改？",
      "sha256": "d406cf1c5cb526d1691d4dced01dbb277ca820447cece83a9469dcfe4ecf9d28"
    }
  ]
}
